{{Passive skill box|Conduit}}

{{about|the keystone passive skill|the divination card|The Conduit}}

{{distinguish|Soul Conduit}}

'''Conduit''' is a [[keystone passive skill]] that shares [[charge]]s with nearby [[party]] members only.

More precisely, whenever the player gains an [[endurance charge]], a [[frenzy charge]] or a [[power charge]], each party member within a radius of 120 units will also gain one charge of the same type.<ref name="radius"/> Minions cannot gain charges this way: They are nearby '''allies''', not '''party members'''.

==Location==
Conduit is located in the center of the skill tree, on the east side of the Scion starting area.
